# HIVE Limited — allow-list only.
#
# This repository is curated by ALLOW-LIST, never by deleting from a full copy:
# a deleted file is one `git log` away, and the withheld material must never appear
# in ANY commit of this repository.
#
# Per-file on purpose: a directory glob ships whatever lands in the directory,
# which is exactly how an accident happens. Every shipped path is named.

*
